        <zone id="26" type-v2="text" x="8500" y="30333" w="28250" h="28889">
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold="true" fontcolor="#ffe600" fontsize="13" fontname="Tableau Semibold">Key finding

</run>
            <run fontcolor="#f2f2f5" fontsize="9">About 1 in 7 federal awards (15.2%) matches a pattern worth a reviewer's time. Most of the value flagged comes from contracts that grew through amendments.

</run>
            <run fontcolor="#f2f2f5" fontsize="9">Service contracts pile up just under the $40,000 limit for sole-sourcing: 10,245 awards in the last $1,000 before it.

</run>
            <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f2f5" fontsize="9">Where to start
</run>
            <run fontcolor="#f2f2f5" fontsize="9">The highest-scoring awards were each sole-sourced within the limit, sit in a run of awards to the same vendor, and were amended past the limit.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr="border-color" value="#000000" />
            <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
            <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
            <format attr="margin" value="0" />
