        <zone id="26" type-v2="text" x="8500" y="30333" w="28250" h="28889">
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold="true" fontcolor="#ffe600" fontsize="13" fontname="Tableau Semibold">Key finding

</run>
            <run fontcolor="#f2f2f5" fontsize="9">Service awards pile up just under the $40,000 limit: 18,990 in the last $5,000, where the trend from the values below predicts 9,900.

</run>
            <run fontcolor="#f2f2f5" fontsize="9">The excess comes from sole-sourced awards (2.63x the trend). Competed awards (1.25x) sit close to the 0.89x to 1.21x that round numbers produce where no rule changes.

</run>
            <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f2f5" fontsize="9">What to review
</run>
            <run fontcolor="#f2f2f5" fontsize="9">2,071 awards sole-sourced within the limit and later amended past it, 576 of them to more than double the limit.</run>
          </formatted-text>
