            <run bold="true" fontcolor="#ffe600" fontsize="13" fontname="Tableau Semibold">Start here

</run>
            <run fontcolor="#f2f2f5" fontsize="9">93% of the queue scores under 30. The awards at the top each were sole-sourced within the limit, sit in a run of awards to the same vendor, and were amended past the limit.

</run>
            <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f2f5" fontsize="9">Next step
</run>
            <run fontcolor="#f2f2f5" fontsize="9">Open the contract file and check the reason given for each amendment.</run>
